{"type":"standard","title":"Ashley Hinson","displaytitle":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Ashley Hinson</span></span>","namespace":{"id":0,"text":""},"wikibase_item":"Q60713905","titles":{"canonical":"Ashley_Hinson","normalized":"Ashley Hinson","display":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Ashley Hinson</span></span>"},"pageid":59720955,"thumbnail":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c8/Congresswoman_Ashley_Hinson_Official_portrait.jpg/330px-Congresswoman_Ashley_Hinson_Official_portrait.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":330,"height":495},"originalimage":{"source":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c8/Congresswoman_Ashley_Hinson_Official_portrait.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","width":1365,"height":2048},"lang":"en","dir":"ltr","revision":"1381916820","tid":"64c9a4f1-d090-11f1-8c1b-5e27c0f14eb4","timestamp":"2026-10-25T16:23:21Z","description":"American politician and journalist (born 1983)","description_source":"local","content_urls":{"desktop":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ashley_Hinson","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ashley_Hinson?action=history","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ashley_Hinson?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Ashley_Hinson"},"mobile":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ashley_Hinson","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:History/Ashley_Hinson","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ashley_Hinson?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Ashley_Hinson"}},"extract":"Ashley Elizabeth Hinson is an American politician, and former broadcast journalist, serving as the U.S. representative for Iowa's 2nd congressional district since 2021. A member of the Republican Party, she was a member of the Iowa House of Representatives for the 67th district from 2017 to 2021.","extract_html":"<p><b>Ashley Elizabeth Hinson</b> is an American politician, and former broadcast journalist, serving as the U.S. representative for Iowa's 2nd congressional district since 2021. A member of the Republican Party, she was a member of the Iowa House of Representatives for the 67th district from 2017 to 2021.</p>"}